---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Matt Rabah, a CX Management, Customer Success, and Implementation professional focused on customer lifecycle systems and practical AI workflows."
>
  <section class="hero container">
    <p class="kicker">About</p>

    <h1 class="display">
      CX management, AI workflow adoption, and customer lifecycle transformation.
    </h1>

    <p class="lead">
      I am a Detroit-based Customer Experience, Customer Success, and
      Implementation professional focused on helping complex customer-facing
      teams improve onboarding, adoption, retention, account health, and
      executive visibility.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section container" aria-labelledby="background">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="background">Background</h2>
    </header>

    <p class="about-prose">
      My background includes NeuroSync, Shinola, and Context By Design, with
      work spanning customer success, healthcare account management, high-touch
      client experience, portfolio growth, CRM process design, lifecycle
      diagnostics, and retention systems.
    </p>

    <p class="about-prose">
      I hold an M.S. in Customer Experience Management from Michigan State
      University’s Eli Broad College of Business, a B.S. in Organizational
      Behavior from Oakland University, and certifications across Salesforce,
      business intelligence, and inbound marketing.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section container" aria-labelledby="focus">
    <header class="section-head">
      <h2 class="section-title" id="focus">Current focus</h2>
    </header>

    <p class="about-prose">
      My current focus is AI-enabled CX management: using practical AI workflows
      to reduce handoff noise, improve account visibility, support better
      customer-facing decisions, and help teams adopt clearer operating systems.
    </p>

    <p class="about-prose">
      Healthcare and medtech are strong target markets for this work because
      they require customer trust, implementation discipline, stakeholder
      coordination, and clear operating cadence. But the broader platform is
      customer lifecycle transformation across complex environments.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>